Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">苹果发布iOS 27更新，Siri引入独立应用并支持切换至ChatGPT</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI联合博通发布首款自研推理芯片Jalapeño，计划2026年底部署</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">GitHub Copilot于6月正式启用量化计费模式，平台使用量创下历史新高</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">高通宣布收购AI软件企业Modular，交易预计于2026年下半年完成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a6352cb59db57baa542ab10cd918d57c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">高通（Qualcomm）正式宣布与AI软件公司Modular达成收购协议，交易预计在2026年下半年完成，目前尚需满足常规成交条件并获得监管批准。Modular的核心业务并非硬件，而是专注于为各类AI XPU提供高效软件栈，其AI原生软件平台支持开发者在不同架构的XPU上实现“一次构建，到处运行”，无需针对特定架构重复编写代码，从而显著提升AI模型的开发效率与运行性能。高通表示，此次收购旨在整合双方优势，将硬件能力与Modular的先进软件技术结合，重点推动AI从终端设备向云端迁移的性能优化。通过此举，高通进一步完善了在AI软件生态系统的战略布局，旨在为客户提供更高效、灵活且易于扩展的AI解决方案，加速AI技术在各行业的广泛应用与普及。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini 3.5 Flash模型，新增计算机操作能力实现自主办公</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于6月25日正式发布Gemini 3.5 Flash模型，核心亮点在于深度优化了“计算机操作（computer use）”能力，标志着AI从对话助手向能够直接操控电脑界面的“行动派”智能体转型。该模型在编程、科研及自主代理任务上的表现均超越3.1 Pro版本，并显著提升了响应速度。Gemini 3.5 Flash已全面覆盖谷歌生态，包括Gemini应用、搜索AI模式，开发者可通过Gemini API或企业版工具调用，同时它也是新一代个人AI代理Gemini Spark的底层驱动。针对增强的自主执行权限，谷歌同步强化了网络安全及CBRN领域的风险控制，引入可控框架，在处理高风险请求时会主动暂停并寻求人工确认。此次更新旨在通过Flash架构优化，让AI能够自主完成跨软件的复杂工作流，最大限度减少人工参与，推动A</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果发布iOS 27更新，Siri引入独立应用并支持切换至ChatGPT</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6813df2e9665452570de95e6957dbdab.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果在iOS 27系统中对Siri进行架构升级，推出全新的独立Siri应用。该应用采用聊天机器人设计，支持文本输入、图片与文档上传，并保留对话历史以辅助复杂协作。在智能化交互方面，苹果引入“双模”机制，用户通过长按输入框点击“Ask…”按钮，即可在系统默认的Siri AI与ChatGPT之间自由切换。目前该功能处于初期迭代阶段，存在交互保护机制，即应用重启后会自动重置为默认的Siri AI模式，且暂不支持将ChatGPT设为永久默认模型。此次更新标志着苹果在保持系统生态安全的同时，通过开放模型集成接口，为用户提供更具生产力的AI交互体验，未来有望接入更多元化的AI模型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI联合博通发布首款自研推理芯片Jalapeño，计划2026年底部署</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d7c9b66cdadb43eb0acbfe4eba475f7c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于6月24日正式发布首款定制化AI推理芯片Jalapeño，标志着其从软件算法向底层硬件架构设计的深度转型。该芯片由OpenAI负责架构设计，博通提供硅片实现与网络支持，Celestica负责板卡集成，从设计到流片仅耗时9个月。Jalapeño专为LLM推理任务打造，在运行GPT-5.3、Codex及Spark等任务时展现出卓越的每瓦性能，通过优化计算、内存与网络资源均衡，显著提升了实际利用率。OpenAI总裁格雷格·布罗克曼表示，此举是构建全栈基础设施战略的关键，旨在降低运营成本并提升智能驱动效率。该芯片计划于2026年底前完成首次部署，作为OpenAI多代计算平台的第一块拼图，将助力其摆脱对单一算力供应的依赖，通过软硬一体化战略重塑算力供应链话语权。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">GitHub Copilot于6月正式启用量化计费模式，平台使用量创下历史新高</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e642665c6fa69d5325155f0e6be424f0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">GitHub于6月1日正式将AI编程工具GitHub Copilot的收费模式由固定统一定价调整为按使用量计费。GitHub技术长弗拉基米尔·费多罗夫证实，该计费变更直接推动了客户使用量大幅激增，使6月成为平台上线以来表现最好的月份。尽管用量激增，GitHub目前暂无大幅调涨价格的计划。此次调整旨在应对来自Cursor、OpenAI Codex及Anthropic Claude Code等原生AI编程工具的激烈市场竞争。然而，用量暴增也对基础设施造成压力，GitHub在2026年已发生数十次重大停机，目前微软正寻求亚马逊云端协助以解决容量限制问题。此次事件标志着AI编程工具市场已进入商业模式与基础设施能力双重竞争的深水区。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
